 message.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"NFC is only supported on iPhones from iPhone 6 and forward. It will not work on iPads since there’s no NFC chip in these devices.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NFC connection to a YubiKey (iOS only)."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"NFCSmartCardConnection establishes a connection to a YubiKey via NFC. The connection","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presents the system NFC dialog and waits for the user to tap their YubiKey.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"NFC connections are short-lived due to iOS timeout constraints. Perform operations quickly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and close the connection with a user-visible message."}]},{"code":["let connection = try await NFCSmartCardConnection(","    alertMessage: \"Hold your YubiKey near the phone\"",")","let session = try await OATHSession.makeSession(connection: connection)","let codes = try await session.calculateCredentialCodes()","await connection.close(message: \"Codes retrieved\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/nfcsmartcardconnection"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Connection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/SmartCardConnection","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit"]]},"references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/NFCSmartCa